Files: unrar_sys/vendor/unrar/*
Copyright: 1993-2024 Alexander Roshal
License: UnRAR
Comment: The UnRAR library (version 7.1, from the unrar_sys crate) is compiled into
 /usr/bin/newskite, where it reads RAR archives in-process. Newskite only extracts
 RAR archives; it cannot create them.

License: OFL-1.1
 The binary embeds static instances of these fonts (generated from the upstream
 variable fonts with fontTools; no glyphs were changed). The full SIL Open Font
 License, Version 1.1, with both copyright notices, is installed as
 /usr/share/doc/newskite/fonts-OFL.txt and is available with a FAQ at
 https://openfontlicense.org

